        01  WS-FPGA-BEYOND-970-STATE.
            05  WS-TPA-BASE-ADDR            PIC 9(05) VALUE 00256.
            05  WS-TH971-BRANCH-OK          PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
            05  WS-TH972-HIST-MERKLE-OK     PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
            05  WS-TH973-SPEC-LAT-OK        PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
